'''Makeshift''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 20th tier in the Survivors Rewards for 50,000 [[Candies (2022)|Candies]] {{Currency|Candies2022}} during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
It resembles a silver antique double barrel pistol with an asymmetrical hole pattern on the barrel. The muzzle of the barrel is tempered with heat, making it appear slightly orange, purple, and blue. It has a small silver bayonet attached underneath the barrel by a wooden clip. The handle, wrapped in red fabric, is small in size and curved.

==Trivia==
*Only players who joined the Survivors team were able to purchase this gun.
*It partners with the [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife [[Makeshift (Knife)|Makeshift]], making the Makeshift set.
*It also partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Bat]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Bat Set|Bat Set]].

